{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22525","headline":"和郑元及第後秋归洛下闲居 · 白居易","name":"和郑元及第後秋归洛下闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勤苦成名後，优游得意间。\n玉怜同匠琢，桂恨隔年攀。\n山静豹难隐，谷幽莺暂还。\n微吟诗引步，浅酌酒开颜。\n门迥暮临水，窗深朝对山。\n云衢日相待，莫误许身闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}